{"channelId":"UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","row":["Margaret Martin, Physical Therapist",234000,"Want stronger bones and body? You're in the right place!\n\nI am a Physical Therapist with 40 years of experience helping people improve their health, reduce pain, & live full, active lives. Over 200,000 people use my books, video workouts, and online courses to improve their bone health, posture, balance, and strength. \n\nI am the creator of MelioGuide™, the leading online provider of safe and effective osteoporosis exercise programs.\n\nI am the author of three books on exercise and fitness including Amazon bestseller Exercise for Better Bones , Yoga for Better Bones, and Strengthen Your Core. I  trained over 12,000 health professionals how to treat people with osteoporosis.\n\nSubscribe to my channel and hit the notification bell so that you will notified when I publish a new video every Tuesday!\n\nSign up for my free course on Exercise and Osteoporosis at https://melioguide.com/free-course/","","Ireland"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:08.695Z","channelId":"UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ffc91bce06faf69f8386dc57da0dd8305c272970e539353fe7ba74ffcfa683f0","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"89485253637912da9cbbc8e9e39457c83bcd2b3311e7ea3ecf5df731c1f24dd7"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:42:16.873Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":234000,"raw":"234K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXclfHBT7W17txHUZnnKqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:08.695Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://melioguide.com/contact/","h